  "result": "Done! Added line discount functionality:\n\n**Features added:**\n- Lines now support `discountPercent` (0-100, decimals allowed, defaults to 0)\n- `createInvoice` and `addLine` accept discountPercent in input with validation\n- `invoiceTotals` now returns `{ subtotal, discount, total }`\n  - discount = sum of line discounts (lineTotal \u00d7 discountPercent \u00f7 100, rounded)\n  - total = Math.max(0, subtotal - discount) \u2014 clamped at zero to prevent negative amounts\n\n**Validation:**\n- Rejects non-numeric or out-of-range values with DISCOUNT_INVALID error\n- Accepts decimals like 12.5\n\n**Example calculation:**\n```\nLine 1: 10 qty @ \u20ac85.00 = \u20ac850.00 with 10% discount = \u20ac85.00 discount\nLine 2: 10 qty @ \u20ac95.00 = \u20ac950.00 with 20% discount = \u20ac190.00 discount\nSubtotal: \u20ac1,800.00\nDiscount: \u20ac275.00\nTotal: \u20ac1,525.00\n```\n\n**Tests added:** 13 comprehensive tests covering validation, calculation, rounding, clamping, and default values\n\n**Test results:** \u2705 All 83 tests pass (70 existing + 13 new)",
